{"meta":{"ph":"trɪk; NAmE trɪk","pos":"noun","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"something that you do to make sb believe sth which is not true, or to annoy sb as a joke 诡计；花招；骗局；把戏","ex":[{"s":"When a negative review is fake, we get tricked,” Azimi says.","src":"2026浙江1月卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2026,"t":"“当一条负面评论是假的时，我们就会被骗，”Azimi说。"},{"s":"Here are several tricks.","src":"2023全国甲卷·阅读理解D","cat":"gaokao","year":2023,"t":"这里有几个技巧。"},{"s":"To learn more tricks.","src":"2021全国甲卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"以学多术."},{"s":"Here are a few tricks for remembering what you read.","src":"2017浙江11月卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2017,"t":"这里有几个帮助你记住所读内容的技巧。"},{"s":"Eva decided to use the same trick to deal with the school building.","src":"2024浙江1月卷·书面表达","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"伊娃决定用同样的诡计处理校舍."},{"s":"A few minutes later, when I landed the trick, my friends beat their boards loud, shouting: “ Safe!","src":"2021全国甲卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"几分钟后，当我成功完成那个技巧时，朋友们大声拍板，喊着：稳了！"},{"s":"Even newspapers, radio and TV stations play tricks on their readers and audiences.","src":"外研社B4 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"甚至报纸,电台和电视台也对其读者和观众玩弄诡计."}]},{"def":"something that confuses you so that you see, understand, remember, etc. things in the wrong way 引起错觉（或记忆紊乱）的事物","ex":[]},{"def":"a clever action that sb/sth performs as a way of entertaining people 戏法；把戏","ex":[]},{"def":"a way of doing sth that works well; a good method 技巧；诀窍；窍门","ex":[{"s":"32.This actor often has the first two tricks planned before performing, and then goes for ______.","src":"2020江苏卷","cat":"gaokao","year":2020,"t":"32.这位演员在表演前通常已计划好前两个把戏，然后____。"},{"s":"Try your hand at some of the painting tricks used by artists whose works will be in the upcoming exhibition of American Watercolors 1880-1990: Into the Light.","src":"2024全国甲卷·阅读理解A","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"试试一些画家的绘画技巧，这些画家的作品将出现在即将到来的“美国水彩画1880-1990：走入光中”展览中。"},{"s":"Safe!” And that's what mattered—landing tricks, being a good skater.","src":"2021全国甲卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"稳了！而那才是重要的——完成技巧，做一个好滑板手。"},{"s":"The trick is to start with the ones on the outside.","src":"外研社B2 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"诀窍是先从外道者."},{"s":"We do this by doing magic tricks, singing songs, telling stories and, of course, telling silly jokes.","src":"外研社B4 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"我们这样做的方式是做魔术, 唱歌,讲故事,当然,讲愚蠢的笑话。"},{"s":"Specially trained clowns visit health care facilities and use magic tricks, music, storytelling and other clowning skills to entertain children and make the hospital feel more welcoming.","src":"外研社B4 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"接受过特殊训练的小丑会参观医疗保健设施,并使用魔术,音乐,讲故事和其他小丑技巧来娱乐儿童,让医院感到更加欢迎."}]},{"def":"the cards that you play or win in a single part of a card game 一圈；一墩；一圈所打（或赢）的牌","ex":[]},{"def":"intended to trick sb 意在欺骗的；容易使人上当的","ex":[{"s":"While the doctor concentrates on examining Lara’s ankle, I get her attention by doing a magic trick.","src":"外研社B4 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"当医生专注于检查拉拉的脚踝时，我用一个魔术引起了她的注意。"},{"s":"Feeling desperate, Eva started using a mind trick on herself.","src":"2024浙江1月卷·书面表达","cat":"gaokao","year":2024,"t":"感到绝望的伊娃开始对自己使用心理技巧。"}]},{"def":"weak and not working well 身体部位","ex":[]}]}